leGix
https://github.com/aicumene/legix

leGix's git engine is gitoxide (https://github.com/GitoxideLabs/gitoxide), created by Sebastian Thiel and developed
by the gitoxide contributors, as of gitoxide v0.59.0 (gix 0.88.0, 25 September 2026), renamed. The git history of
this repository records the authors of every change, gitoxide's and leGix's.

